    "summary": "Use it in any phase, immediately after an **ADEPTA SORORITAS CHARACTER** model of yours is **destroyed**; that model is the target. You may discard 1 to 3 [Miracle dice](vsdata:ability/adepta-sororitas.acts-of-faith). As the phase ends:\n\n- Set the model back up **[unengaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)**, as near as it can be to the spot where it was destroyed.\n- It no longer belongs to an **[attached unit](vsdata:core-rule/attached-units)**, and the unit it now forms has a **[starting strength](vsdata:core-rule/units-and-models)** equal to 1.\n- Roll a D3 and add 1 per Miracle die discarded; the model has that many wounds left, up to its starting wounds.\n\n**SAINT CELESTINE** cannot be the target, and no **CHARACTER** can be the target twice in 1 battle.",
